name: check-upkeep
description: "Run the project's upkeep pass: outdated dependencies and their known breaking changes, known vulnerabilities in what the product ships and builds with, expiring certificates and keys, deprecated platform features, failing or lately slow checks. It reads and files only — every finding goes through to-backlog — and it is model-invoked when the work calls for it; a project with nothing outdated hears that in one line. Where the harness can schedule it, it may be scheduled; never assume a scheduler."
